Alola, Alola! I’m your host Jennis, and welcome to the Mantine Super Surf Qualifier!


We’ve got a long week ahead of us, fam — and it all starts right here on Orientation Day!


Surfing kicks off tomorrow, but today? Today we set the stage.
[div=
font-family:var(--h-font);
font-size:var(--h1-size);
letter-spacing:4px;
text-transform:uppercase;
color:#e8f7ff; text-align:center;
text-shadow:0 0 12px rgba(120,200,255,.18);]
Day 0: Orientation Day
[/div]
Surfers and spectators alike, this is your time to settle in, link up, and get your sea-legs under you before we hit open water.


[div=
margin-top:6px;
font-size: var(--tagline-size);
font-family: var(--tagline-font);
letter-spacing:3px;
text-transform:uppercase;
color:#7db7d6;]House-Boat Accommodations[/div]
For the next week, you’ll be living the ocean life aboard one of our floating homes:
[list]
[*] Single Rider Skiffs — solo surfers, solo stories 
[*] Twin Hulls — shared rides, shared vibes 
[*] Cabin Boats — 3–4 person crews, tight-knit ohana on the waves 
[/list]
Anyone looking to pilot their own vessel, head down to the bay for a crash course in boat handling and safety.


No experience needed — just don’t sink the vibe or the ships, yeah?
[div=
font-family:var(--h-font);
font-size:var(--h1-size);
letter-spacing:4px;
text-transform:uppercase;
color:#e8f7ff; text-align:center;
text-shadow:0 0 12px rgba(120,200,255,.18);]The Grand Flotilla[/div]
Leading the charge is our flagship:


[div=
margin-top:6px;
font-size: var(--tagline-size);
font-family: var(--tagline-font);
letter-spacing:3px;
text-transform:uppercase;
color:#7db7d6;] Lālū Lele[/div]
Home of the judges, announcements, and major event calls. If something important’s going down, it’s coming from here.


Docked alongside her:


[div=
margin-top:6px;
font-size: var(--tagline-size);
font-family: var(--tagline-font);
letter-spacing:3px;
text-transform:uppercase;
color:#7db7d6;]Surging Sous[/div]
Our restaurant ship — breakfast, lunch, dinner, all week long.


Head Chef Gauss-Ohm Ramspark will be running the kitchen, serving up meals sure to electrify your taste-buds!


Be sure to try out their signature Alola Breakfast Pancakes!


Bringing up the rear:


[div=
margin-top:6px;
font-size: var(--tagline-size);
font-family: var(--tagline-font);
letter-spacing:3px;
text-transform:uppercase;
color:#7db7d6;]Cruising Comfey[/div]
Medical support vessel, staffed by Nurse Joy and crew. If you get wiped out, they’ll get you back on your feet.


[hr][/hr]


At midnight, the Grand Flotilla sets sail.


And we won’t be sailing alone.


We move with the rhythm of the ocean itself — guided out by the Moon-Tide Parade, the seasonal migration of Chinchou, Frillish, and other luminous sea Pokémon.


For the first three nights, mother-nature lights the ways—waters bright even in the dead of night!
